on-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Tabata</surname><given-names>T.</given-names></name></person-group> (<year>2002</year>). <article-title>Physiological properties of periodontal mechanoreceptive neurons in the posteromedial ventral nucleus of rat thalamus</article-title>. <source>Arch. Oral Biol.</source><volume>47</volume>, <fpage>689</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>694</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0003-9969(02)00030-4</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12243972</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B24"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Urbain</surname><given-names>N.</given-names></name></person-group> (<year>2007</year>). <article-title>A new pathway of vibrissal information modulated by the motor cortex</article-title>. <source>J. Neurosci.</source><volume>27</volume>, <fpage>12407</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>12412</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1523/JNEUROSCI.2914-07.2007</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17989305</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B25"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Vahle-Hinz</surname><given-names>C.</given-names></name></person-group> (<year>1983</year>). <article-title>Principal differences in the organization of the thalamic face representation in rodents and felids</article-title>. In <source>Somatosensory Integration in the Thalamus</source>, <person-group person-group-type="editor"><name><surname>Macchi</surname><given-names>G. A.</given-names></name></person-group>, eds (<publisher-loc>Amsterdam</publisher-loc>, <publisher-name>Elsevier</publisher-name>), pp. <fpage>125</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>145</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B26"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Van der Loos</surname><given-names>H.</given-names></name></person-group> (<year>1976</year>). <article-title>Barreloids in mouse somatosensory thalamus</article-title>. <source>Neurosci. L